{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">PROVERSION function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310399","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PROVERSION-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PROVERSION-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"PROVERSION-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">PROVERSION function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PROVERSION-function__section_N10029_N10026_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the version of ABL, or release of OpenEdge, you\nare running. You can also optionally retrieve additional release\ninformation, such as the service pack version number and the hot\nfix version number.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PROVERSION-function__syntax_GC1A10T2700506\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d124304e99\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PROVERSION-function__idGDN2SW2674777\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>PROVERSION <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong>(<var class=\"keyword varname\">mode</var>)<strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">mode</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An optional integer expression that identifies how much version information\nis returned, as follows:<ul class=\"ul\"><li class=\"li\">If the value of <var class=\"keyword varname\">mode</var> is either <code class=\"ph codeph\">0</code> or not specified,\n                PROVERSION returns limited version information—the major version number, the minor\n                version number, and, if applicable, the version tag.</li><li class=\"li\">If the value of <var class=\"keyword varname\">mode</var> is <code class=\"ph codeph\">1</code>, PROVERSION\nreturns full version information—the major version number, the minor\nversion number, the service pack number, the hot fix version number,\nthe build number, and, if applicable, the version tag. </li><li class=\"li\">If the value of <var class=\"keyword varname\">mode</var> is other than <code class=\"ph codeph\">1</code> or <code class=\"ph codeph\">0</code>,\n                a run-time error message is returned.</li></ul></dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PROVERSION-function__example_GC1A10U2700524\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d124304e176\">Examples</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">Following is an example of the information PROVERSION returns when you use\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">1</code> as the <var class=\"keyword varname\">mode</var> value for an FCS OpenEdge release, which\n        has no version tag:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PROVERSION-function__idGDO2RA2674785\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>11.2.0.0.1234</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <p class=\"p\">in which:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">11</code> is\nthe major version number.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">2</code> is the minor version number.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">0</code> is the service pack number.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">0</code> is the hot fix version number.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">\n          <code class=\"ph codeph\">1234</code> is the build number.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">If you specify <code class=\"ph codeph\">0</code> as the mode value (or specify no mode value at all) for\n        an OpenEdge BETA release, you see the major version number, the minor version number, and\n        the version tag. For example:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PROVERSION-function__idGDO2RB2674789\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>11.2BETA</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <p class=\"p\">If you specify <code class=\"ph codeph\">1</code> as the mode value for an OpenEdge BETA release, for\n        example, the following details appear:</p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PROVERSION-function__idGDO2RC2674793\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>11.2.0.0.1234.BETA</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PROVERSION-function__see-also_GC1A10W2700540\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d124304e300\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DBVERSION-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DBVERSION-function.html\">DBVERSION function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PROGRESS-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PROGRESS-function.html\">PROGRESS function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PROPATH-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PROPATH-statement.html\">PROPATH statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PUBLISH-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PUBLISH-statement.html\">PUBLISH statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310399","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"PROVERSION function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PROVERSION-function.html","type":"Manual"}